Interactive Quiz Web App

This is a simple interactive quiz web application built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. The quiz features multiple-choice questions, tracks the user's progress, and displays the final score.

Features

Multiple-choice questions with radio buttons

Progress bar to visualize quiz completion

Real-time score tracking

Responsive design for mobile compatibility

Interactive feedback with animations

Technologies Used

HTML5

CSS3

JavaScript

Bootstrap 5

Project Structure

Interactive-Quiz/
├── index.html
├── index.css
├── index.js
└── README.md

Open index.html in a web browser.

Usage

Start the quiz by selecting your answer using the radio buttons.

Click the Submit Answer button.

The progress bar will update, and the next question will appear.

After completing the quiz, your final score will be displayed.

Customization

You can modify questions and answers by editing the questions array in index.js.

Adjust colors, sizes, and other styles in index.css.

Modifying Progress Bar Color

